# XBD <sys/un.h>
# Copyright (c) 2026 Nicholas Martin. All rights reserved.
#
# The size and position of sun_path in <sys/un.h>. Each says why it has no
# mutant yet.

assertion  XBD.sys_un.h.001
anchor     basedefs/sys_un.h.html#DESCRIPTION/sun_path
class      required
since      2001
says       <sys/un.h> alone defines sa_family_t as an unsigned integer type and
           struct sockaddr_un with sun_family of type sa_family_t and, after it,
           a char array sun_path of at least 92 bytes; nothing but alignment
           padding follows sun_path.
note       Only the necessary condition for sun_path being last is checked: the
           structure does not extend past it by as much as its alignment.
test       t/001-sun-path.c
nomutant   compile-time check; needs the Tier 0 header mutants
